{"id":"trampa","lemma":"trampa","pos":"noun","rank":958,"glosses":["trap, snare","cheating, cheat (violation of rules to gain an advantage)","trapdoor (hinged or sliding door set into a floor)"],"ipa":"/ˈtɾampa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"trampas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/7a/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-trampa.wav","examples":[{"text":"Podría ser una trampa.","en":"It may be a trap.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/442671","words":[{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to be"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Esto no es una trampa.","en":"This is not a trap.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/501629","words":[{"g":"this"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"¿Quién hizo trampas?","en":"Who cheated?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/439035","words":[{"g":"who"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},null]},{"text":"¿Por qué la gente hace trampas?","en":"Why do people cheat?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/506310","words":[null,null,{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"people"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},null],"phrases":[[0,2,"why, for what reason"]]},{"text":"Huele a una trampa.","en":"It smells like a trap.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/501630","words":[{"g":"to smell","l":"oler"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"a"},null]}]}